        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-31T03:20:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Workbench says if you discard a card you put a golem into play, so if someone else did you wouldn't get to play the golem.</p><p>I believe that discarding is personal, if it isn't it says so, like Chrono-Ranger's card. &nbsp;Equipment and ongoing are generally treated the opposite way, with it specifying if it is your card, otherwise it is any.</p>",
